      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Adding avatar switching to the FX layer would lead to it being used in all sorts of ways, like attach to visemes. Build some avatars a certain way and you'll have players constantly changing avatars. \n\nIf you're wanting to change avatar via expression menu, then that is where you should suggest it be added. Add another type of control and provide avatar ID in the expression menu.\n\nI don't know if this is good idea or not, but maybe it could be for private avatar only, or it needs confirmation. A lot of people accidentally hit things in expression menu.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
